@page "/about"

<PageTitle>D&D 3.5 Character Tool</PageTitle>

<h1>D&amp;D 3.5e Character Creation Tool</h1>

<p>A mechanically accurate character building and display tool for D&amp;D 3.5 Edition.</p>

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Character Sheet</h5>
                <p class="card-text">View a character's stats at any HD level with the level slider.</p>
                <a href="sheet" class="btn btn-primary">View Sheet</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Character Builder</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Build a character tick-by-tick, selecting race, class, feats, and skills.</p>
                <a href="builder" class="btn btn-primary">Build Character</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
